 "description": "Part 2 of Copycat! I'm Lelac, aka BaoChickaWowWow, and Dawn has had ENOUGH of Olive... or so we thought.\n\nWe try life as a wildcat (with a very helpful Nature Expert), get chased by a dog, sneak back to Olive's house only for her not to recognize us, starve, fight the OTHER cat for our home, and then... Olive takes us for a car ride. I'm not crying, you're crying.\n\nTell me in the comments: would you forgive Olive?\n\nIf you enjoyed it, like and subscribe so you don't miss Part 3.\n\nCHAPTERS\n{CHAPTERS}\n\n#BaoChickaWowWow #Copycat #CopycatGame #LetsPlay #Gameplay #FirstPlaythrough #Part2",
